  "body": "## What changed\n\nEach theme now gives the ribbon row heights, the gaps and the glyph ink. The shell reads them from the active table. It has no row number and no ink literal of its own.\n\n- New tokens in `Tokens`: `ribbon_ink` (colour), `ribbon_tab_h`, `ribbon_cell_top_gap`, `ribbon_caption_gap`, `ribbon_caption_row_h`, `ribbon_bottom_gap` (geometry). Theme files set them under `colors` and `geometry`.\n- `theme::ribbon_h` sums the rows, the gaps and `cell_h` of the active table.\n- Both theme files set the rows 24 / 4 / 12 / 18 / 4. The caption gap is 12 (the table says 8 or larger) because `glyph_px` is 22 in both files, and the button label would touch the caption at 8.\n- `teal-night` ink is white. `horizon-day` ink is `#1F242A`: its ribbon ground is near white, and white would vanish there.\n- `contrast::readable` refuses a theme whose ribbon ink reads under 4.5:1 on the ribbon ground.\n- The fixed colour tint per family (`family_tint`) is removed.\n- Base: row layout and tests of closed PR #1999, with the hard-coded values moved into the tables.\n\n## Screenshots (offscreen, 1280x800)\n\nBefore (PR #1999 image, main state):\n![before](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/a1eedbe28cf583e499f658b6958b6750fcafabf1/pr-1999/ribbon-before.png)\n\nAfter, Horizon Day:\n![after horizon-day](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/75d4eacda0347a95333a3bac02dc02915b580d57/pr-2021/ribbon-after-horizon-day.png)\n\nAfter, Teal Night:\n![after teal-night](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/75d4eacda0347a95333a3bac02dc02915b580d57/pr-2021/ribbon-after-teal-night.png)\n\n## Tests\n\nIn `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/ribbon_rows.rs`:\n- `each_theme_has_the_ribbon_rows_of_the_table_or_larger`\n- `tab_text_and_caption_text_fit_their_rows_in_each_theme`\n- `ribbon_ink_reads_on_the_ribbon_ground_in_each_theme`\n- `a_theme_with_unreadable_ribbon_ink_is_refused`\n- `ribbon_text_rows_stack_top_to_bottom`\n\nResults: `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib --test theme_files` 821 + 14 passed. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean. `BROWSER_TREE_TOP` and the machine page tests are updated for the taller ribbon. No snapshot PNG changed.\n\n## Round 2: file split (head 90f24d076)\n\n`theme.rs` was 447 lines. Code moved unchanged, public paths kept:\n- `theme/tables.rs` (100 lines): `Tokens::DARK` and `Tokens::LIGHT`.\n- `theme_files/overlay.rs` (81 lines): `apply_overlay`.\n- `theme.rs` is now 359 lines. `theme_files.rs` is 405 lines. `painted.rs` is 442 lines (451 on main, so it shrank). `panes.rs` shrank and stays over 400 as before.\n\nGate after the split: `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib ribbon` 18 passed, `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --test theme_files` 14 passed, `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib theme` 23 passed, `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Pixel snapshot lane (release tier only).\n- The other crates and the full workspace.\n- A visible app window. The images come from the offscreen test harness.\n- `panes.rs` is over 400 lines and shrank. It is not split in this PR.\n\nDecision file: `docs/decisions/2021-theme-ribbon-tokens.md`.\n\nChangelog: The ribbon rows and the ribbon glyph ink come from the theme, so tab text, captions and glyphs have space and read clearly in Horizon Day and Teal Night.\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #2021\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n\n\n\n## Refresh\n\n- Old head: `90f24d076acafb4bf756f916d3aac6965a7e0be5`\n- New head: `739b7ce5ea8272a73ec1d2c942b9a6a4c2faa318` (merge of `origin/main` `17a8c6e76`)\n- Resolved hunk: `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`, the test module list. This branch added `mod ribbon_rows;` and `main` added `mod waterjet_recipe;` at the same line. The merge keeps the two lines. No other file conflicted. `git diff origin/main --name-only` lists only the files of this PR.\n- Tests (`camcraft-ui`, debug, `-j 6`, `--test-threads=6`):\n  - `--lib -- theme ribbon_rows waterjet_recipe`: 26 passed, 0 failed (5 `ribbon_rows`, 2 `waterjet_recipe`, 19 theme).\n  - `--test theme_files`: 14 passed, 0 failed.\n  - `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- Delta class: no collaborator review marker exists for the old head. Thus no `--delta` class is necessary, and the PR needs its normal review.\n",
